{"type":"message","id":"e66f3895","parentId":"4006399c","timestamp":"2026-06-24T08:28:18.291Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"You are the analyzer agent.\n\nTASK ID: task-001\n\nTASK: Analyze GitHub Issue #86\n\nDESCRIPTION:\nFetch and analyze GitHub issue #86 from https://github.com/vhallac/semblr/issues/86 and all its comments.\n\nSteps:\n1. Fetch the issue via GitHub API: `curl -s https://api.github.com/repos/vhallac/semblr/issues/86`\n2. Fetch all comments: `curl -s https://api.github.com/repos/vhallac/semblr/issues/86/comments`\n3. Read the issue body and all comments thoroughly\n4. Extract: what is being requested, any implementation details discussed, edge cases, acceptance criteria\n5. Determine a suitable feature branch name based on the issue title/number (e.g., `feature/86-short-description`)\n6. Read relevant project files: VISION.md, README.md, the main extension source (src/semblr.ts), and any related code to understand current architecture\n\nWrite a comprehensive analysis to: /home/vedat/work/personal/semblr/temp/issue-86-analysis.md\n\nThe analysis MUST include:\n- Issue title and summary\n- All requirements extracted from issue and comments\n- Feature branch name recommendation\n- Current codebase context (relevant files, architecture points)\n- Implementation approach outline\n- Any open questions or ambiguities\n\nDO NOT rely on stdout — write all findings to the file.\n\nComplete this task using available tools. Report STATUS when finished."}],"timestamp":1782289698269}}
